        en: "Last week I ordered a new phone case on the internet. The courier brought the parcel two days late. I opened it and saw a problem: the case was damaged. I was angry, so I called the shop. The woman on the phone said, “I apologize for the delay and for the damaged case. It was a misunderstanding in our warehouse. We will send you a new one, or you can have a refund.” I said, “A new one, please.” She said, “Sorry for the inconvenience. It will arrive on Friday.”",
